<style>
  .product-faq {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .faq-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .faq-container h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #1b4332;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    padding: 24px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .faq-question {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #1b4332;
  }
  .faq-answer {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: none;
  }
  .faq-toggle {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #2d6a4f;
  }
</style>

<section class="product-faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-container">
      <h2>Your Questions Answered</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display = (this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block')">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span>When will I see results?</span>
          <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Consistency is key. Most users report feeling calmer within the first week, while significant BP regulation typically shows within 4-6 weeks of regular intake.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display = (this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block')">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span>Are there any side effects?</span>
          <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          BP Balance Daily is 100% herbal and free from synthetic chemicals. There are no known side effects when taken at the recommended dosage.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display = (this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block')">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span>Can I take this with my current BP medication?</span>
          <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Yes, but we recommend maintaining a 1-hour gap between this and your conventional medication. Always consult your physician before starting any new supplement.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" onclick="this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display = (this.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block')">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span>Is it safe for long-term use?</span>
          <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Absolutely. In Ayurveda, herbs like Arjuna are considered tonics that strengthen the system over time without creating dependency.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
